title: JushiD2_Start
position: 3541,912
---
<<if $D2Finished>>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<set $D2Started to true>>
I: 15:49. Lay Buddhist Hou is coming back to the shop.
<<if $LikeU>>
<<endif>>
//这里暂停一下沟通页面，空格后重新pull up
<<pause_dialogue>>
I: 16:20.
<<wait 1>>
<<play_sfx "doorbell">>
<<wait 0.8>>
<<show_character "jushi">>
<<wait 0.3>>
Jushi: Miss! Miss!
Jushi: I, I need a lifesaver here, right now!
Jushi: Grab me a pot I can give my son's girlfriend. 
Jushi: Hurry, I'm gonna meet her family for the first time in a minute.
I: Huh?
Jushi: Oh, don't you dawdle! Come here!
Jushi: Dinner's at 17:30.
Jushi: They're probably already heading out to play cards before it starts.
(Hou clicks her tongue sharply.
The same woman with shoulder-length hair, her head still slightly bowed...)
//这里暂停一下沟通页面，空格后重新pull up
<<pause_dialogue>>
I: Oh! Of course. Here is the catalog. Everything here is in stock. 
(You hurriedly hand her the catalog. 
She literally snatches it with one hand.)
//这里暂停一下沟通页面，空格后重新pull up
<<pause_dialogue>>
I: I'll get the box and gift bag ready. 
I: Please tell me what you're looking for in the meantime.
I: Then we can choose a pot together. 
Jushi: Ugh, what is there to "look for"? (She clicks her tongue.)
Jushi: That chick is from Chongqing. 
Jushi: Did her undergrad in electrical engineering here in China, about to go abroad for grad school.
Jushi: She'll be in the same cohort as my son.
Jushi: Ugh, I don't know much else, okay?
I: Ah, a first meeting. Both sides must be nervous.
I: Take a breath. Someone with your grace and poise—
I: Once she meets you, it'll only win your son extra points.
Jushi: Mm.
(Silence hangs heavy between the two of you.
For a while.)
//这里暂停一下沟通页面，空格后重新pull up 
<<pause_dialogue>>
<<jump JushiD2_FirstSilence>>
===

