title: JushiD2_Phones
position: 2259,1812
---
(Hou's phone rings.)
Jushi: Hello? Hello?
(Hou snatches up her phone.)
Jushi: There's no seat for me at the table? 
Jushi: What?
Jushi: [b]How dare you? On what ground?! [/b]
Jushi: That is [b]my[/b] child—I gave birth to him!
Jushi: What do you mean [b]you[/b] paid for all four years of his undergrad?!
Jushi: Fine, I didn't pay his tuition, but he is still my own flesh and blood.
Jushi: I put everything I had into raising him, too
Jushi: You wrinkled old man, 
Jushi: What do you mean I [b]wouldn't[/b] take him with me?!
Jushi: It is not my surname that he is bearing. He has his father's surname! [b]And thus yours![/b] 
Jushi: You flat-out refused to let me take him upon, upon my departure. 
Jushi: His grandmother would cry just from washing his clothes!
Jushi: I...
Jushi: I gave in for just one moment, and...
<<pause_dialogue>>
Jushi: I had to work.
<<pause_dialogue>>
(Hou scratches her scalp in agitation, lets out a long sigh, and lowers her voice.)
Jushi: Answer this——Who will Chang Yuantao's son call Grandma someday?
Jushi: (Her voice suddenly pitches shrill again.) Chang Yuantao's stepmother?!
Jushi: Or that great-grandmother of his, who calls her own grandchildren son!
(She suddenly smiles, rather gently.
She ends the call in one swift motion and dials another number.)

//这里暂停一下沟通页面，空格后重新pull up
<<pause_dialogue>>
Jushi: Hello? Hello, Principal Kuai!
Jushi: Yes, Principal Kuai. Hope you and your wife are both keeping well, 
Jushi: mm, yes. 
Jushi: I'm tied up at a Zen meditation retreat today, just can't quite get away. 
Jushi: Mm-hm, ahha, of course. 
Jushi: Wonderful--You're most welcome. Yuantao told me all about it.
Jushi: I'm terribly sorry for his visit—the moment he flew back to China, 
Jushi: he went straight to stay at your place for two whole weeks. What an imposition.
Jushi: If the boy had only told us, we would never have been so remiss in our manners.
Jushi: Thank goodness you've been so gracious with him.
Jushi: Mm, yes, of course. 
(She grips the phone, cupping half her face and the hand holding it with her other hand, listening gravely.)
(The warmth she had summoned for the call melts away from her face. 
She bites her lip and nods silently.)
Jushi: Yes, what a pair of adorable lovebirds.
(Hou smiles gently, and the warmth surges back into her face.)
Jushi: Mm-hm, I'll have to present myself through gifts today—I really can't make it in person.
Jushi: Once Yuantao's grandfather takes the whole family to visit Chongqing, 
Jushi: let's get together properly.
Jushi: Mm. (She touches her burning cheek and hangs up.)
[b]【I hear the call of [u]MBTI[/u] and [u]Bilbo[/u]】[/b]
Jushi: (She gives you a gentle smile.) Haha. No rush anymore.
Jushi: You heard it all anyway. I won't pretend otherwise. 
Jushi: Just call a courier to deliver the gift to the Kempinski.
Jushi: That'll do.
Jushi: Wrap it nicely, take your time—there's no hurry now.
Jushi: I want it arriving right around 18:00, halfway through their dinner.
Jushi: As for what to send... we can take our time picking it out.
Jushi: What were those collections you mentioned earlier?
(You gently turn the catalog back to the contents page.)
//这里暂停一下沟通页面，空格后重新pull up
<<pause_dialogue>>
<<if ($D2TriedFamily or $D2TriedWelcome) and ($D2TriedSmall or $D2TriedBird or $D2TriedPeach)>>
    // 两个系列都介绍过
    I: Oh, the [b]Heritage Collection[/b].
    Jushi: Those two from [b]Boudoir Charms[/b], as you have mentioned, weren't bad either.
    Jushi: Forget the lovebirds—he's already on the other side of the earth. 
    Jushi: If they fly any farther, I'll never see him again.
    Jushi: The peach one was nice, though. Round and rather sweet.
    (She smiles gently at you.)
    Jushi:  You won't rule those two out just because I snapped at you a bit, would you? 
<<elseif $D2TriedFamily or $D2TriedWelcome>>
    // 只介绍过传世系列
    I: Oh, the [b]Heritage Collection[/b].
    I: I was looking at the catalog again. [b]Boudoir Charms[/b] could work too.
    (Hou smiles gently.)
<<elseif $D2TriedSmall or $D2TriedBird or $D2TriedPeach>>
    // 只介绍过闺趣系列
    I: Oh, [b]Boudoir Charms[/b].
    I: I was looking at the catalog again. [b]Heritage Collection[/b] could work too.
    (Hou smiles gently.)
<<else>>
    // 两个系列都没介绍过，直接低头翻册子
    I: My bad, I hadn't quite had the chance to introduce them yet.
    I:  We could look at either the [b]Heritage Collection[/b] or [b]Boudoir Charms[/b].
    (Hou smiles gently.)
<<endif>>
<<jump JushiD2_GiftMenu>>
