title: JushiD2_MeiZhuang
position: 1757,687
---
(As you speak, you take out two lenticular cards and hand them to Hou.
While she compares and handles them, 
you turn toward the display cabinet, scanning the shelves for the actual teapots.)
//这里暂停一下沟通页面，空格后重新pull up
<<pause_dialogue>>
(Found them at last! You place them before Hou.)
I: I don't think young women necessarily want blessings about making a good home anymore,
I: especially if she's eager to go out and make her own way.
I: [i]"Plum blossoms grow fragrant through bitter cold."[/i] Who wouldn't appreciate that? 
(Hou studies the teapot without answering. She runs her fingers across the sculpted clay.)
Jushi: This stump has real strength to it.
Jushi: It's already been cut down, yet it still has the strength to stand against the wind.
Jushi: The Plum Blossom one just has a few plum branches tacked onto a round body.
Jushi: But with this one, the stump and the pot are one.
Jushi: ...Alright. This one isn't tacky.
<<jump JushiD2_MeiZhuangConfirm>>
===

title: JushiD2_MeiZhuangConfirm
