    <<set $D2Pack to 2>>
<<elseif $D2Pack == 2>>
    (You open the gift box and lay in the lining.)
    <<set $D2Pack to 3>>
<<elseif $D2Pack == 3>>
    (You choose a ribbon of the right color, measure it, and cut it to length.)
    <<set $D2Pack to 4>>
<<elseif $D2Pack == 4>>
