title: JushiD2_DaughterInLawIntro
---
Jushi: To be frank, I don't like this girl.
I: Why? Haven't you said you've never met her?
Jushi: Hmph. Living together before marriage, for starters. 
(She bites her lip again.)
Jushi: Did I mention this? My son only comes home to China once a year, 
Jushi: and this time he didn't even come back to Yixing—
Jushi: Without a word to us, that girl whisked him straight off to Chongqing.
Jushi: It puts us completely on the back foot. 
(She clicks her tongue.)
<<jump JushiD2_AfterGiftChoice2>>
===

title: JushiD2_DaughterInLaw
---
// 从这里开始粘贴
Jushi: Don't you young girls love posting every little thing online?
Jushi: She listens to rock music, 
Jushi: with all that black stuff around her eyes and on her lips.
Jushi: A while ago she was making a fuss about some ... menstruation thing. 
Jushi: How, how does she even have the nerve?
Jushi: And she was campaigning for that pink-haired girl who took her own life. 
Jushi: Good heavens.
Jushi: You don't understand. You really don't. 
Jushi: My son is a very, [b]very[/b] kindhearted person.
Jushi: Way too considerate of everyone else's feelings, always swallowing his own hurt.
Jushi: It's all his grandparents' fault for raising him wrong!
Jushi: I've got a rebellious streak myself. That's why I could never get along with them.
(Hou bites at the dead skin on her lip.)
Jushi: You only live once. You should live as you please and stop bending over backwards for others.
I: Well, if she wants to study abroad and listen to rock, 
I: maybe she's trying to make her own choices too.
Jushi: That's [b]her[/b] business.
Jushi: I could control her? I don't even have a say in my own son's life.
(She glances at her phone.)
Jushi: My son can't handle a girl with that much rebellion in her.
Jushi: I mean it. She had such a good undergraduate record. 
Jushi: She turned down a guaranteed graduate-school place just to see what studying abroad would be like.
Jushi: She's got a scholarship, too.
Jushi: My son isn't that sharp. 
Jushi: He was originally just going to apply to grad school for the heck of it and look for a job along the way.
Jushi: She pushed him into it.
Jushi: My son can't handle her. He's too soft.
Jushi: If she gets him under her thumb, he'll be the one paying dearly for it.
Jushi: I'm not even encouraging him to date right now. 
Jushi: It's his grandfather who's been pushing it.
[b]【I hear the call of [u]Bilbo[/u]】[/b]
<<jump JushiD2_PackRemaining>>
===

